# Text is stored and checked out with LF everywhere, so the fixtures and the tests that compare bytes behave the
# same on Windows as on the Mac (Brief 22). Binary files are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.car binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary

# Files that are CRLF on purpose, kept byte for byte: the fonts' licences (unmodified) and the CRLF fixture.
src/ui/theme/fonts/**/OFL.txt -text
test/fixtures/series/Codex/Windows.md -text
